Third-Party Notice (Optional Portable Binary Releases)

The SATB Splitter source code in this repository is licensed under the MIT
License above.

Optional pre-built Windows portable binary releases
(SATB-Splitter-*-Windows-Portable.zip) bundle a modified build of Audiveris
for offline Optical Music Recognition (OMR), which is licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0). See the bundled
Audiveris/LICENSE_AGPL3.txt and Audiveris/MODIFICATIONS.md files inside the
portable release, as well as the corresponding source archive
(audiveris-dev3l-source-patches.zip) published alongside the release.
